# Build output of the OER and course-book PDF builds (docs/oer/build_oer.py,
# docs/build_course_books.py). docs/_render_math.py caches every rendered
# equation as an SVG here; the SVGs already committed stay tracked, and new
# cache entries are regenerated on demand by the next build, so they are not
# committed.
docs/assets/figures/_math/
# OER intermediate: build_oer.py writes it and deletes it after each build, and
# `make clean` removes it. The copy in git is a stale snapshot kept only because
# it was committed; untrack it with `git rm --cached docs/oer/book.math.md`.
docs/oer/book.math.md

# Participant logbooks (docs/plan_2026-11/LOGBOOK_SPEC.md): private, never committed
**/workspace/logbook/
